      "module": "lesen",
      "title": "Starting a New Hobby",
      "text": "Starting a new hobby can be a fantastic way to spend your free time. Many people find (1) ______ they are looking for a new challenge, they often choose something creative like painting or learning to play a musical instrument. It is important (2) ______ choose an activity that you truly enjoy, rather than one that you think you should do. Some people prefer to join a club (3) ______ they can meet others who share the same interests. This is a great way (4) ______ make new friends while learning a new skill. If you are not sure where to start, try looking online (5) ______ inspiration. Remember that you do not need to be an expert (6) ______ the beginning; the most important thing is to have fun and keep trying.",
